Meta.documentation:httpServer
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:An HTTP acceptor: emits one httpConnection per accepted request.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Per accepted request it fires a lifecycle over its outputs:
Meta.documentation:  out_begin              - start of request processing
Meta.documentation:  out_httpConnection     - the accepted request as a resource: it holds the
Meta.documentation:                           req/res pair from this handle and runs the
Meta.documentation:                           reply session (see httpConnection:)
Meta.documentation:  out_request_headers    - { method, url, headers }, always if bound
Meta.documentation:  out_request_<Type>     - the request body cast through the Content-Type
Meta.documentation:There are no return values in Dawn: the reply STREAMS into the connection,
Meta.documentation:which writes its own res; a silent handler is answered the connection's
Meta.documentation:default when the end event reaches it through the flow. The canonical
Meta.documentation:handler names the connection with var: and closes the flow at its
Meta.documentation:reference, with the handler body a list:
Meta.documentation:  httpServer:0#|httpConnection>>[var:httpConnection:con ... >>con:]
Meta.documentation:Requests are serialized. Without a bound connection the acceptor answers
Meta.documentation:itself: 204 when other request ports fired, 404 when nothing was routed.
Meta.documentation:Requests are serialized. An unanswered request is answered by the acceptor
Meta.documentation:itself after a short grace window: 204 routed-but-silent, 404 when
Meta.documentation:nothing was bound.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port out_httpConnection - the accepted request as a value, one per request
Meta.documentation:@port out_request_headers - request meta ({method,url,headers})
Meta.documentation:@port out_request_octetstream - body fallback, binary cast of the request body
Meta.documentation:@port out_request_String - String body (text/* content-type)
Meta.documentation:@port out_request_Data - Data body (application/json content-type)
Meta.documentation:@see httpConnection
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status experimental

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0Aconst%20ConnectionRes%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Scheme%2FhttpConnection%22)%3B%0Aconst%20http%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20require(%22node%3Ahttp%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20httpServer%3Aport%20%E2%80%94%20an%20HTTP%20acceptor.%20Per%20request%3A%20build%20an%20httpConnection%0A%2F%2F%20(creation%20wires%20the%20req%2Fres%20pair%20and%20the%20request%20meta%20into%20it%20%E2%80%94%20see%0A%2F%2F%20httpConnection%3A)%2C%20then%20begin%20%E2%86%92%20connection%20%E2%86%92%20headers%20%E2%86%92%20typed%20body%20%E2%86%92%20end%20over%0A%2F%2F%20the%20outputs.%20Dawn%20has%20no%20return%20values%3A%20the%20reply%20STREAMS%20into%20the%0A%2F%2F%20connection%2C%20which%20writes%20its%20own%20res%3B%20a%20silent%20handler%20is%20answered%20the%0A%2F%2F%20connection's%20default%20when%20the%20end%20event%20reaches%20it%20through%20the%20flow.%20The%0A%2F%2F%20canonical%20handler%20names%20the%20connection%20with%20var%3A%20and%20dispatches%20through%0A%2F%2F%20the%20var's%20subscription%20broadcast%2C%20with%20the%20handler%20body%20a%20list%3A%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20httpServer%3A0%23%7ChttpConnection%3E%3E%5Bvar%3AhttpConnection%3Acon%20%E2%80%A6%20%3E%3Econ%3A%5D%0A%2F%2F%20Requests%20are%20serialized.%20Without%20a%20bound%20connection%20the%20acceptor%20answers%0A%2F%2F%20itself%20(204%20when%20other%20request%20ports%20fired%2C%20404%20when%20nothing%20was%20routed).%0Afunction%20httpServer()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22httpServer%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%20%3D%20httpServerProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20httpServerProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%0A%09let%20server%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09let%20started%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%09%2F%2F%20serialize%20request%20handling%3A%20flows%20run%20one%20at%20a%20time%2C%20in%20accept%20order%0A%09let%20tail%20%3D%20Promise.resolve()%3B%0A%0A%09this.out_httpConnection%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.out_request_headers%20%20%20%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.out_request_octetstream%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.out_request_String%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.out_request_Data%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20the%20acceptor%20drives%20the%20request%20lifecycle%20itself%2C%20per%20request%2C%20out%20over%0A%09%2F%2F%20its%20bound%20outputs%3B%20the%20program's%20own%20start%2Fstop%20must%20not%20leak%20into%20it%0A%09this.in_begin%20%3D%20function()%20%7B%7D%3B%0A%09this.in_end%20%20%20%3D%20function()%20%7B%7D%3B%0A%0A%09this.in_instanciate%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20newObject%20%3D%20this.get_resource().clone()%3B%0A%09%09newObject.port%20%3D%20parseInt(decodeURIComponent(input.value%20%7C%7C%20%22%22))%20%7C%7C%200%3B%20%2F%2F%200%20%3D%20ephemeral%0A%09%09return%20newObject.instanciate_processor()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09this.in_go%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(started)%20return%3B%0A%09%09started%20%3D%20true%3B%0A%09%09const%20self%20%3D%20this%3B%0A%09%09server%20%3D%20http.createServer(function(req%2C%20res)%20%7B%0A%09%09%09tail%20%3D%20tail.then(function()%20%7B%20return%20self.handle(req%2C%20res)%3B%20%7D)%0A%09%09%09%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20.catch(function(err)%20%7B%0A%09%09%09%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%09console.log(%22httpServer%20handler%20error%3A%20%22%20%2B%20(err%20%26%26%20err.stack%20%7C%7C%20err))%3B%0A%09%09%09%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%09if%20(!res.headersSent)%20%7B%20res.statusCode%20%3D%20500%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09%09%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%09res.end(%22httpServer%3A%20500%20internal%20error%22)%3B%0A%09%09%09%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D)%3B%0A%09%09%7D)%3B%0A%09%09server.listen(resource.port%2C%20function()%20%7B%0A%09%09%09console.log(%22httpServer%20listening%20on%20port%20%22%20%2B%20(server.address()%20%3F%20server.address().port%20%3A%20resource.port))%3B%0A%09%09%7D)%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09this.handle%20%3D%20async%20function(req%2C%20res)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09const%20chunks%20%3D%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%09%09req.on(%22data%22%2C%20c%20%3D%3E%20chunks.push(c))%3B%0A%09%09await%20new%20Promise(function(done)%20%7B%20req.on(%22end%22%2C%20done)%3B%20%7D)%3B%0A%09%09const%20body%20%3D%20Buffer.concat(chunks)%3B%0A%0A%09%09const%20meta%20%3D%20%7B%20method%3A%20req.method%2C%20url%3A%20req.url%2C%20headers%3A%20req.headers%20%7D%3B%0A%09%09const%20contentType%20%3D%20(req.headers%5B%22content-type%22%5D%20%7C%7C%20%22%22).split(%22%3B%22)%5B0%5D%3B%0A%09%09const%20value%20%3D%20await%20Dawn.cast(contentType%2C%20body%2C%20req.url)%3B%0A%0A%09%09const%20self%20%3D%20this%3B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20no%20connection%20bound%3A%20the%20acceptor%20answers%20itself%20before%20any%20connection%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20exists%20(204%20when%20other%20request%20ports%20fired%20or%20a%20body%20was%20cast%2C%20404%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20when%20nothing%20at%20all%20was%20routed)%0A%09%09if%20(!self.out_httpConnection)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09if%20(self.out_begin)%20await%20self.out_begin()%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(self.out_request_headers)%20await%20self.out_request_headers(meta)%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(value)%0A%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09const%20bodyPort%20%3D%20self%5B%22out_request_%22%20%2B%20value.get_resource().name%5D%3B%0A%09%09%09%09if%20(bodyPort)%20await%20bodyPort(value)%3B%0A%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%09if%20(self.out_end)%20await%20self.out_end()%3B%0A%09%09%09respond(res%2C%20undefined%2C%20(self.out_request_headers%20%7C%7C%20value)%20%3F%20204%20%3A%20404)%3B%0A%09%09%09return%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20the%20connection%20holds%20the%20req%2Fres%20pair%20from%20this%20handle%20and%20runs%20the%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20reply%20session%3A%20in_go%20presents%20the%20request%20to%20the%20pipe%2C%20in_response_%24all%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20replies%20to%20res%2C%20in_end%20answers%20the%20default%20when%20the%20handler%20stayed%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20silent%20(grace%20window%20for%20async%20repliers)%0A%09%09const%20conRes%20%3D%20new%20ConnectionRes()%3B%0A%09%09conRes.value%20%3D%20meta%3B%0A%09%09conRes.req%20%20%20%3D%20req%3B%0A%09%09conRes.res%20%20%20%3D%20res%3B%0A%09%09conRes.defaultStatus%20%3D%20204%3B%0A%09%09conRes.body%20%20%3D%20new%20Uint8Array(body)%3B%20%2F%2F%20the%20raw%20request%20bytes%2C%20for%20handlers%20that%20need%20them%20(PUT%20%2F_file)%0A%09%09const%20con%20%3D%20conRes.instanciate_processor()%3B%0A%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20request%20lifecycle%20outward%3A%20begin%20%E2%86%92%20connection%20%E2%86%92%20headers%20%E2%86%92%20body%20%E2%86%92%20end%3B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20accumulating%20handlers%20seal%20at%20end%20and%20stream%20the%20reply%20into%20the%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20connection%20(by%20way%20of%20the%20handler's%20var%20reference)%0A%09%09if%20(self.out_begin)%20await%20self.out_begin()%3B%0A%09%09await%20self.out_httpConnection(con)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(self.out_request_headers)%20await%20self.out_request_headers(meta)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(value)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09const%20bodyPort%20%3D%20self%5B%22out_request_%22%20%2B%20value.get_resource().name%5D%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(bodyPort)%20await%20bodyPort(value)%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09if%20(self.out_end)%20await%20self.out_end()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%20anything%20streamed%20into%20the%20connection's%20reply%20port%20%E2%86%92%20response%20on%20the%20wire%0Afunction%20respond(res%2C%20reply%2C%20status)%0A%7B%0A%09if%20(reply%20%3D%3D%3D%20undefined%20%7C%7C%20reply%20%3D%3D%3D%20null)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09res.statusCode%20%3D%20status%20%7C%7C%20204%3B%0A%09%09res.end()%3B%0A%09%09return%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%09if%20(reply.get_resource)%20%2F%2F%20a%20resource%3A%20cast%20by%20its%20type%20name%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09const%20r%20%3D%20reply.get_resource()%3B%0A%09%09const%20v%20%3D%20r.value%3B%0A%09%09if%20(r.contentType)%20%2F%2F%20the%20true%20content-type%20wins%20(cast%20stamps%20it%20on%20loaded%20values)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09if%20(v%20instanceof%20Uint8Array)%0A%09%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20r.contentType%2C%20Buffer.from(v))%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22Data%22%20%7C%7C%20r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22List%22)%0A%09%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20r.contentType%2C%20JSON.stringify(v%20!%3D%3D%20undefined%20%3F%20v%20%3A%20(r.elements%20%7C%7C%20%5B%5D)))%3B%0A%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20r.contentType%2C%20String(v))%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09if%20(r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22String%22%20%7C%7C%20r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22Number%22%20%7C%7C%20r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22Boolean%22)%0A%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20String(v))%3B%0A%09%09if%20(r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22Data%22%20%7C%7C%20r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22List%22)%0A%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22application%2Fjson%22%2C%20JSON.stringify(v%20!%3D%3D%20undefined%20%3F%20v%20%3A%20(r.elements%20%7C%7C%20%5B%5D)))%3B%0A%09%09if%20(r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22octetstream%22)%0A%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22application%2Foctet-stream%22%2C%20Buffer.from(v%20instanceof%20Uint8Array%20%3F%20v%20%3A%20new%20Uint8Array(0)))%3B%0A%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20String(v))%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%09switch%20(typeof%20reply)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09case%20%22string%22%3A%20%20return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20reply)%3B%0A%09%09case%20%22number%22%3A%0A%09%09case%20%22boolean%22%3A%20return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20String(reply))%3B%0A%09%09case%20%22object%22%3A%0A%09%09%09%2F%2F%20verbatim%20escape%20hatch%3A%20%7B__dawnResponse%3A%7Bstatus%2CcontentType%2Cheaders%2Cbody%7D%7D%0A%09%09%09if%20(reply%20%26%26%20reply.__dawnResponse)%0A%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09const%20r%20%3D%20reply.__dawnResponse%3B%0A%09%09%09%09if%20(r.headers)%20for%20(const%20k%20of%20Object.keys(r.headers))%20res.setHeader(k%2C%20r.headers%5Bk%5D)%3B%0A%09%09%09%09const%20body%20%3D%20r.body%20%3D%3D%3D%20undefined%20%3F%20%22%22%20%3A%20(r.body%20instanceof%20Uint8Array%20%3F%20Buffer.from(r.body)%20%3A%20String(r.body))%3B%0A%09%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20r.status%20%7C%7C%20200%2C%20r.contentType%20%7C%7C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20body)%3B%0A%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%09if%20(reply%20instanceof%20Uint8Array)%0A%09%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22application%2Foctet-stream%22%2C%20Buffer.from(reply))%3B%0A%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22application%2Fjson%22%2C%20JSON.stringify(reply))%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C204%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20%22%22)%3B%0A%7D%0Afunction%20send(res%2C%20status%2C%20contentType%2C%20body)%0A%7B%0A%09res.statusCode%20%3D%20status%3B%0A%09res.setHeader(%22content-type%22%2C%20contentType)%3B%0A%09res.setHeader(%22Content-Security-Policy%22%2C%20CSP_HEADER)%3B%0A%09res.end(body)%3B%0A%7D%0Aconst%20CSP_HEADER%20%3D%20%22default-src%20*%20'unsafe-eval'%20'unsafe-inline'%20data%3A%20blob%3A%3B%20script-src%20*%20'unsafe-eval'%20'unsafe-inline'%3B%20style-src%20*%20'unsafe-inline'%3B%20img-src%20*%20data%3A%20blob%3A%3B%20font-src%20*%20data%3A%20blob%3A%3B%22%3B%0AhttpServer.Processor%20%3D%20httpServerProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%20%3D%20httpServer%3B%0A]>>NewResource:httpServer
